          %p
            Discussion of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/torsion+of+a+G-structure"} torsion-invariants
            of almost symplectic structures includes
          %ul
            %li#AlbuquerquePicken11
              Rui Albuquerque, Roger Picken,
              %em On invariants of almost symplectic connections
              (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1107.1860"}> arXiv:1107.1860
              )
          %p
            The generalization of the notion of symplectic manifolds to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dg-manifolds"} dg-manifolds
            is sometimes known as
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/NQ-supermanifolds"} PQ-supermanifolds
            , due to
